# Input

```scss
$suffix:   ".active" ;
.card:not( /* excluded */.disabled )#{ /* suffix */ $suffix }{color:red}
.card[ data-state ]#{ $suffix /* attribute suffix */ }{color:blue}
.card:not(.disabled)  #{ /* descendant */$suffix}{color:red}
.card[data-state]
#{$suffix}{color:blue}
.card:not(.disabled)#{$suffix}Tail{color:red}

```


# Formatted

```scss
$suffix: ".active";
.card:not(/* excluded */ .disabled)#{ /* suffix */ $suffix } {
	color: red;
}
.card[data-state]#{ $suffix /* attribute suffix */ } {
	color: blue;
}
.card:not(.disabled) #{ /* descendant */ $suffix} {
	color: red;
}
.card[data-state] #{$suffix} {
	color: blue;
}
.card:not(.disabled)#{$suffix}Tail {
	color: red;
}

```
